    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds an Action Category" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Action Category</p>
            <p>Creates a new action category with a random mapping reference.</p>
            <step>1. Navigate to Settings → Actions Setup. 2. Click Add. 3. Enter Category Name and Mapping Reference. 4. Save the category.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Toast "Action category has been added." is displayed.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
